{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xs7oQLa2AnfXhK6GE8mDuZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tstatic irqreturn_t tc_irq_handler(int irq, void *arg)\n2\t{\n3\t\tstruct tc_data *tc = arg;\n4\t\tu32 val;\n5\t\tint r;\n6\t\n7\t\tr = regmap_read(tc->regmap, INTSTS_G, &val);\n8\t\tif (r)\n9\t\t\treturn IRQ_NONE;\n10\t\n11\t\tif (!val)\n12\t\t\treturn IRQ_NONE;\n13\t\n14\t\tif (val & INT_SYSERR) {\n15\t\t\tu32 stat = 0;\n16\t\n17\t\t\tregmap_read(tc->regmap, SYSSTAT, &stat);\n18\t\n19\t\t\tdev_err(tc->dev, \"syserr %x\\n\", stat);\n20\t\t}\n21\t\n22\t\tif (tc->hpd_pin >= 0 && tc->bridge.dev && tc->aux.drm_dev) {\n23\t\t\t/*\n24\t\t\t * H is triggered when the GPIO goes high.\n25\t\t\t *\n26\t\t\t * LC is triggered when the GPIO goes low and stays low for\n27\t\t\t * the duration of LCNT\n28\t\t\t */\n29\t\t\tbool h = val & INT_GPIO_H(tc->hpd_pin);\n30\t\t\tbool lc = val & INT_GPIO_LC(tc->hpd_pin);\n31\t\n32\t\t\tdev_dbg(tc->dev, \"GPIO%d: %s %s\\n\", tc->hpd_pin,\n33\t\t\t\th ? \"H\" : \"\", lc ? \"LC\" : \"\");\n34\t\n35\t\t\tif (h || lc)\n36\t\t\t\tdrm_kms_helper_hotplug_event(tc->bridge.dev);\n37\t\t}\n38\t\n39\t\tregmap_write(tc->regmap, INTSTS_G, val);\n40\t\n41\t\treturn IRQ_HANDLED;\n42\t}\n43\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6f105e5b-12d0-432d-a407-67e263779c57","uuid":"9acafbf0-dcbd-46b3-899b-5364222704b0","timestamp":"2026-11-20T00:45:41.139Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/yangkaiyan/Desktop/EECS4080/blind-run/samples/s223.c","content":"static irqreturn_t tc_irq_handler(int irq, void *arg)\n{\n\tstruct tc_data *tc = arg;\n\tu32 val;\n\tint r;\n\n\tr = regmap_read(tc->regmap, INTSTS_G, &val);\n\tif (r)\n\t\treturn IRQ_NONE;\n\n\tif (!val)\n\t\treturn IRQ_NONE;\n\n\tif (val & INT_SYSERR) {\n\t\tu32 stat = 0;\n\n\t\tregmap_read(tc->regmap, SYSSTAT, &stat);\n\n\t\tdev_err(tc->dev, \"syserr %x\\n\", stat);\n\t}\n\n\tif (tc->hpd_pin >= 0 && tc->bridge.dev && tc->aux.drm_dev) {\n\t\t/*\n\